# policy: a prefix list and a route map
set policy route prefix-list SAMPLER-PL rule 10 action permit
set policy route prefix-list SAMPLER-PL rule 10 prefix 10.0.0.0/8
set policy route route-map SAMPLER-RM rule 10 action permit
set policy route route-map SAMPLER-RM rule 10 match ip address prefix-list SAMPLER-PL
